Parts of this crate port Go modules that apron-server-go depends on, or
match their behavior byte for byte. Each module's license follows.

- src/rate.rs ports golang.org/x/time/rate (v0.16.0).
- src/webp.rs ports the configuration path of golang.org/x/image/webp
  (v0.46.0).
- src/aprond/acme ports golang.org/x/crypto/acme/autocert (v0.57.0).
- src/webauthn, src/cbor.rs, tests/webauthn_protocol/, and the files in
  tests/data/webauthn port github.com/go-webauthn/webauthn (v0.18.2). The
  JSON files in tests/data/webauthn are copied from its tests.
- src/ws.rs reproduces the behavior of github.com/coder/websocket (v1.8.14).
- src/aprond/options.rs ports the parts of github.com/jessevdk/go-flags
  (v1.6.1) that aprond uses, with its error texts and help layout.
- src/cbor.rs decodes CBOR as github.com/fxamacker/cbor/v2 (v2.9.4) does when
  go-webauthn configures it.
- The --print-config encoder in src/aprond/config.rs matches the output of
  github.com/BurntSushi/toml (v1.6.0).

